  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "loft extension via front and rear dormers",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The applicant has failed to provide any bicycle parking or shown a location where it would be accessible and acceptable. The development would, therefore, be contrary to Policy LP45 of the Hackney Local Plan&nbsp;and Policy T6 of the London Plan (2021).",
    "The applicant has failed to show any waste storage solutions at the property and therefore the proposal fails to meet the requirements set out within Hackney Local Plan policy LP57.",
    "By reason of insufficient and conflicting information submitted on the application form and drawings, the local planning authority is unable to fully assess the proposals.&amp;nbsp;",
    "In the absence of a Unilateral Undertaking or a Section 106 agreement securing appropriate mitigation by restricting future occupiers of the development from obtaining parking permits within the Controlled Parking Zone, the development would likely exacerbate existing parking stress and congestion on the surrounding highway network. The application is, therefore, contrary to policy LP45 (Parking and Car-Free Development) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) and policy T6 (Car parking) of the London Plan (2021)."
  ],
